OL,3,GNEWSAVisually impaired man at ease
OL,4,Aflying a plane
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been a forever experience for
OL,7,Fsomeone who is disabled," said Michael,
OL,8,F66, who has a visual impairment.
OL,10,FFlynqy Pilot Training in partnership
OL,11,Fwith charity Aerobility is giving
OL,12,Fdisabled people the chance to
OL,13,Fexperience flying for themselves by
OL,14,Fpiloting a light aircraft through its
OL,15,FCornwall Flying Scholarship programme.
OL,17,FThanks to the initiative Michael, who
OL,18,Flives in Cornwall, was given full
OL,19,Fcontrol by an instructor for a short
OL,20,Fflight during an event at Cornwall
OL,21,FAirport Newquay on 11 September.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
